			(property "Description" "Generic 3-wire analog water/air/oil pressure transmitter, 0-0.2MPa range, ratiometric analog output (nominally '0-5V', typically 0.5V@0psi to 4.5V@full-scale on a 5V supply per this sensor family's usual transfer function - confirm against your specific unit's datasheet/label). Red=VCC(5V), Black=GND, Yellow=OUT."
