		(property "Description" "TSL2591 high dynamic range lux sensor breakout (Adafruit-style, 'TSL2591 Lux Sensor' silkscreen), 6-pin 2.54mm header: Vin, GND, 3V3 (regulated output of onboard LDO, also usable as a 3.3V supply input bypassing the regulator), INT (open-drain interrupt), SDA, SCL. I2C address 0x29 fixed. Vin accepts 3-5V."
